=== 2. the tree factor is (1 + 1/k), not 2 ===
   k =   1 permutations unrolled per leaf -> overhead 2.0000   (1 leaf plane families + one per level)
   k =   2 permutations unrolled per leaf -> overhead 1.5000   (2 leaf plane families + one per level)
   k =   4 permutations unrolled per leaf -> overhead 1.2500   (4 leaf plane families + one per level)
   k =   8 permutations unrolled per leaf -> overhead 1.1250   (8 leaf plane families + one per level)
   k =  16 permutations unrolled per leaf -> overhead 1.0625   (16 leaf plane families + one per level)
   k =  64 permutations unrolled per leaf -> overhead 1.0156   (64 leaf plane families + one per level)

