=== 6. what the '+0.37 s' headline leaves out ===
  (a) the gadget's OWN degree-7 zero-check, per endpoint at Mistral:
      layout A (~130-term forms): 4.66e+10 Goldilocks mul-adds; at 1e10..1e11 op/s = 0.47..4.66 s per endpoint
      layout C (<=34-term forms): 2.67e+10 Goldilocks mul-adds; at 1e10..1e11 op/s = 0.27..2.67 s per endpoint
  (b) no GPU kernel exists above degree 4 (kernels.cu:601 '#define SC_DEG 4').
      host/GPU ratio measured on the private feed-forward at 12x512: 7.62x
      125M, Poseidon2 w12 r8: 51.32% of words -> +2.39 s if on GPU, +18.18 s if the slot runs on the host (391% of the 4.649 s pass)
      125M, RescuePrimeOpt w12 r8: 41.75% of words -> +1.94 s if on GPU, +14.78 s if the slot runs on the host (318% of the 4.649 s pass)
  (c) mask-row host generation: the MR1 lane found host mask cost = 53% of the repaired profile's added cost; not modelled here.

